\code{effect_rsa_view}, \code{effect_crossnobis_view} -- a stored \code{effect_geometry},
and an unevaluated \code{effect_geometry_plan} each signal capability
\code{"additive_contribution"}. Branch on them with \code{\link[=catch_refusal]{catch_refusal()}}.
